{"id":"f744fc361db0ee96","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md","title":"共同后果预序与其商偏序","display":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 共同后果预序与其商偏序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories","aliases":["91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories","91-df-truth-theory-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 共同后果预序与其商偏序","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories</span><span>91-df-truth-theory-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 共同后果预序与其商偏序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T\">\\(\\mathfrak T\\)</span> 为理论集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为共同语言的句子类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为预序记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[S]_{\\mathcal C}\">\\([S]_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 是后果等价类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(\\mathfrak T,\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}),\\qquad\n[S]_{\\mathcal C}\\le[U]_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(\\mathfrak T,\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}),\\qquad\n[S]_{\\mathcal C}\\le[U]_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等价类关系与代表元选择无关，且反对称：双向后果包含正好给同一等价类。因此得到商偏序，但理论本身一般只有预序。\n本节点复用唯一强度签名，不再重复定义 Th_C 和比较关系。具体标准系统的链属于依赖对应强度定理的命题，不能作为抽象层级定义的一部分。\n有类型/无类型是原书 Definition 10.1 的理论分类，不是“语言能否写自应用句”的简单句法开关；预序也不自动给出翻译、定义等价或序数。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 与各系统的强度分析；本地后果预序及其商构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak T$ 为理论集，$\\mathcal C$ 为共同语言的句子类；$\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}$ 使用 [[91-df-truth-strength]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"[S]_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(\\mathfrak T,\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}),\\qquad\n[S]_{\\mathcal C}\\le[U]_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U.","display":true}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-langu